    ],
    "text": "I, Wijesundara Mudiyanselage Thilakarathne Bandara Ekanayake,Acting Minister of Lands hereby declare under Sub-section (1) ofSection 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the land described belowis needed for a public purpose and will be acquired under theprovisions of that Act.",
